  "title": "Designing VS Code’s UX for the Agentic Era",
  "description": "Joanna will pull back the curtain on how VS Code's design team is quietly retooling the editor for the agentic era — not with a big rewrite, but with hundreds of small, deliberate UX shifts. She'll share real examples, the tradeoffs behind them, and a few things her team got wrong along the way. It's a candid look at evolving a product millions of developers already love.",
